    <briefdescription>
<para>Built-in conflict resolution strategy: 3-Way Merge. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Performs structural merge of BPMN/CMMN models using base, local, and remote versions. Requires base version to be present in <ref refid="structthemis_1_1process_1_1_conflict_context" kindref="compound">ConflictContext</ref>. </para>
